  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The custom emoji feature needs to be removed indefinitely because 99% of all of them are either porn or gore.  Don't believe me?  Join a random public lobby and click on the \"emoji\" report tab and just look at em.  Me and my friends report these kinds of emojis literally every single day and nothing seems to be getting done about it.\n\n  Even worse, I've seen the same exact offenders do it over and over again, one in particular who simply switched accounts and does it more.  Showing porn/gore to minors (public lobbies) should be an instant account, hwid, & ip ban, not the current slaps on the wrists being given out the way it is now.  This lack of moderation is just embarrassing.\n\n  You guys clearly are not utilizing some kind of filter system upon upload, so this seems to be the only solution for now until you guys actually figure something out.",
